                                                "sense_id": "a395f798-5c5b-3278-a311-a2b65b60da8a",
                                                "text": "[…] she kept toying with a pair of old sunglasses which lay beside her on the kitchen table. One of the bows had been mended with adhesive tape, and one of the lenses was cracked."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
